Flow Steward BigQuery extension
Copyright 2026 Flow Steward contributors

This extension packages a modified Google MCP Toolbox for Databases v1.16.0,
commit 06ea49d9a487a72c22419b5a8d5c22c11f0d7485.
Copyright Google LLC; licensed under Apache-2.0 (included in LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox

The source patch adds workflow statement and dataset policy validation,
ordinary native table verification, stable write job IDs, structured job
metadata, bounded result output and managed short-lived OAuth authentication.
Only the BigQuery source and SQL tool are registered. Build pins and patch
accompany the package; native checksums are recorded in
 toolbox-provenance.json and SHA256SUMS.

